# Per-image run records: 17,584 images and 20 GB across every evaluation run.
# run-state.json already carries every resolved_prompt_sha256, workflow_sha256,
# and image_sha256, and the matrix is deterministically re-exportable, so the
# evidence chain stays verifiable without committing these. The review contact
# sheets live in the innofree/krea2-wildcards dataset on the Hugging Face Hub.
tests/reports/phase7_*/runs/
tests/reports/**/*.png
tests/reports/**/*.jpg
tests/reports/**/*.jpeg
tests/reports/**/*.webp
# Except the two images the reproducibility proof attests to. A proof nobody can
# recheck is not a proof, and test_reproducibility hashes both of these, so a
# fresh clone cannot verify determinism without them. 1.5 MB for the pair.
!tests/reports/production_smoke_v0_1/runs/crystal_iris_pastel_seed_6006/image_01.png
!tests/reports/reproducibility_v0_1/repeat/runs/crystal_iris_pastel_seed_6006/image_01.png

# Transient codex/gstack skill scratch: gstack-paths resolves TMP_ROOT into the
# repo, and codex stderr captures contain local account identifiers that
# check_sensitive_data.py correctly refuses to commit.
.gstack/
